":"Realizing that he and Yachiyo both have the same day off, Jun finally finds the courage to ask her out for drinks. Meanwhile, Yamada devises multiple plans to get Sota to pet her again.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7QrP7njFayrRlzfWJAx38wbbKVB.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Realizing that he and Yachiyo both have the same day off, Jun finally finds the courage to ask her out for drinks. Meanwhile, Yamada devises multiple plans to get Sota to pet her again.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7QrP7njFayrRlzfWJAx38wbbKVB.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10995","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20819","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"25879","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46153","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"145211","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"19852","synopsis":"As Kyōko remains spaced out over the previous day's events, Popura tries to act more reliable to fill in for her, while Mitsuki tests Jun to see how compatible he is with Yachiyo. Meanwhile, Sōta is bewildered over suddenly finding Mahiru to be cute, outright denying Kirio's suggestion that he might be in love with her. While trying to compliment Mahiru on how much she's improved with her anthrophobia, Sōta inadvertently upsets her by suggesting she find someone else to fall in love with.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rlCt9FeoN3lMDAYhx9aZLH6d7Nn.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"As Kyōko remains spaced out over the previous day's events, Popura tries to act more reliable to fill in for her, while Mitsuki tests Jun to see how compatible he is with Yachiyo. Meanwhile, Sōta is bewildered over suddenly finding Mahiru to be cute, outright denying Kirio's suggestion that he might be in love with her. While trying to compliment Mahiru on how much she's improved with her anthrophobia, Sōta inadvertently upsets her by suggesting she find someone else to fall in love with.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rlCt9FeoN3lMDAYhx9aZLH6d7Nn.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10995","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20819","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"25879","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46153","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"145211","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"23695","synopsis":"While Sōta remains stressed over the other day's events, Izumi, assuming he had broken up with Popura, tries to set Sōta and Mahiru up with each other, unaware of the actual circumstances between them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wkcmbLHjn9TxzP2TYo3kj1pj7wR.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"While Sōta remains stressed over the other day's events, Izumi, assuming he had broken up with Popura, tries to set Sōta and Mahiru up with each other, unaware of the actual circumstances between them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wkcmbLHjn9TxzP2TYo3kj1pj7wR.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10995","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20819","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"25879","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46153","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"145211","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"19858","synopsis":"As Sōta feels conflicted over his feelings towards Mahiru, Aoi, wanting Hiroomi to give her some attention, tries to obtain information on the blossoming relationships. Later, Popura gets a toothache and takes the day off, having a dream where she becomes a magical girl. Meanwhile, Kirio ends up discovering Aoi, who is revealed to be the sister he was searching for, and is met with resistance when he tries to take her back home.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8w91SVUH40cUmv2D4JLtzVXSXfi.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"As Sōta feels conflicted over his feelings towards Mahiru, Aoi, wanting Hiroomi to give her some attention, tries to obtain information on the blossoming relationships. Later, Popura gets a toothache and takes the day off, having a dream where she becomes a magical girl. Meanwhile, Kirio ends up discovering Aoi, who is revealed to be the sister he was searching for, and is met with resistance when he tries to take her back home.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8w91SVUH40cUmv2D4JLtzVXSXfi.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10995","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20819","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"25879","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46153","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"145211","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"19856","synopsis":"Staying over at Sōta's house, Aoi explains her backstory about being constantly forced to study by her mother, inevitably pointing out the reason she ran away was because Kirio ate her natto. As the other staff members try to convince Aoi to return home over the next few days, Popura asks Kirio to bring over his mother, Kikuno, who is revealed to have trouble talking with others clearly to the point that her children need a manual to understand her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rdHBszNgpVTZYpToG6JwbPD1EVN.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Staying over at Sōta's house, Aoi explains her backstory about being constantly forced to study by her mother, inevitably pointing out the reason she ran away was because Kirio ate her natto. As the other staff members try to convince Aoi to return home over the next few days, Popura asks Kirio to bring over his mother, Kikuno, who is revealed to have trouble talking with others clearly to the point that her children need a manual to understand her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rdHBszNgpVTZYpToG6JwbPD1EVN.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10995","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20819","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"25879","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"46153","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"145211","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"19855","synopsis":"With Aoi's situation resolved, Sōta continues to be in denial over his feelings for Mahiru. Meanwhile, having finally learned Yachiyo's birthday, Jun gives her all the presents that he hadn't had the courage to give her before. Later, Aoi gets herself a cellphone, which she attempts to use to communicate with Kikuno, while Popura becomes depressed when she believes she's gotten shorter.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/TJK8dxl206CuXIuzsz5PnOIBjG.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"With Aoi's situation resolved, Sōta continues to be in denial over his feelings for Mahiru. Meanwhile, having finally learned Yachiyo's birthday, 